## F2. Phase 1 — Plugins active on each page

  HOMEPAGE (src/app/page.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────
  - WordPress REST API         → page content, hero text, featured products
  - WooCommerce REST API       → bestseller / featured product list
  - Omnisend                   → email signup form (embed their JS snippet)
  - Tidio                      → chat widget (load script in layout.tsx)
  - Pixel Manager              → page_view event (GTM dataLayer push)

  SHOP PAGE (src/app/shop/page.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────────
  - WooCommerce REST API       → product list, categories, pagination
  - Discount Rules for WC      → sale badge / promo badge on product card
  - WPC Price by Quantity      → "buy 2 get X%" teaser on card (if applicable)
  - WiserReview                → star rating display on product card
  - Pixel Manager              → view_item_list event per product shown

  PRODUCT DETAIL PAGE — PDP (src/app/shop/[slug]/page.tsx)
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  - WooCommerce REST API       → product data, variations, images, description
  - Elixser Rewards Custom     → bundle stepper (1/2/3 vial variation swap) ← rebuild required
  - WPC Price by Quantity      → price-per-tier table (e.g. 1 vial $X, 2 vials $Y)
  - Discount Rules for WC      → promo badge / savings display
  - WiserReview                → review widget embed (their JS, keyed by product ID)
  - WPLoyalty                  → "earn X points with this purchase" preview text
  - Attentive                  → set window.attn_product global on page load
  - Pixel Manager              → view_item event (product name, price, variant)

  CART PAGE (src/app/cart/page.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────────
  - Zustand store              → cart lines (variation_id + qty)
  - Elixser Rewards Custom     → bundle stepper in cart (same component as PDP)
  - WPLoyalty                  → show earned points total + apply reward coupon field
  - Discount Rules for WC      → applied discount badge / savings amount
  - Attentive                  → set window.attn_cart global on every cart change
  - Pixel Manager              → view_cart event

  CHECKOUT (src/app/checkout/page.tsx)
  ─────────────────────────────────────
  - Tagada lib                 → build INIT_CHECKOUT payload → redirect to Tagada
  - Elixser Rewards v0.3       → loyalty coupon must be applied to Woo cart BEFORE redirect
                                  so the WP hook mirrors it to Tagada promotions
  - Tracking metadata          → pass tgd_tracking_meta cookies + utm params to Tagada

  RETURN PAGE (src/app/return/page.tsx)  — shared handoff for ALL tracking
  ──────────────────────────────────────
  - Zustand store              → clear cart on arrival
  - Attentive                  → set window.attn_order  (orderId, total, email, phone, items)
  - Omnisend                   → fire purchase/conversion event
  - Pixel Manager              → purchase event (use transaction_id to dedup)
  - WPLoyalty                  → points confirmation message (read from /elx/v1/loyalty/me)

